  "-1634434716": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kate",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Wow. This place has furniture and everything. You guys must be loaded.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1186458217": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Hello, you must be Kate. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "333647359": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kate",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Nice to meet you, Mrs. Mom.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-907670698": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Just Anna is fine. I’ve heard a bit about you.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "970463317": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kate",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Hopefully nothing that can be used in court. Also I brought this. No idea what it is. I picked the bottle that looked the least threatening.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1979554082": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "You chose well. It won’t bite.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1039820645": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Mhm. You must really like spending time with my {S}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-909540676": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -742440815,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Hey! I'm glad you're here tonight.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1326353691": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -742440815,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "That’s honestly more than I expected. Come in.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "159056251": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -742440815,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Hey, Kate. I'm glad you're finally visiting me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "775125957": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kate",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Mm, not super long. But he’s cool. Chill vibe, good listener, and doesn’t pretend to know more than he does, which is honestly refreshing.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1363750145": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kate",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Yeah, he’s kinda the only guy I can talk to without feeling like I’m in a job interview. And he laughs at my dumb jokes, so that’s bonus points.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "956233103": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Well, I’m glad you came. It’s nice seeing someone so... relaxed",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "415076374": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Most girls who visit are trying much harder.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1072963371": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kate",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Facts.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-908279033": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So you and my {S}… known each other long?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1666191930": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kate",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Yikes. I hope I’m not flunking the {M} test.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1236324301": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "No, no. You’re fine.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "441164026": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Just remember—have fun tonight… but not too much.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
